# IT Tender Wizard — Native Frappe Desk Pattern (hard lock)

Canonical doc: [`NATIVE_DESK_ARCHITECTURE.md`](apps/kentender_v1/docs/std-prod-impl/IT-STD-Wizard/NATIVE_DESK_ARCHITECTURE.md)

## Required

1. **Production screens** — native Frappe Desk page, single DOM, no iframe.
2. **Thin registrars** — `*_page.js` only registers the route and `frappe.require`s shared + screen modules.
3. **Shared library** — use `public/js/it_wizard/` (`shell`, `components`, `routes`, `api`) and `public/css/kt_it_wizard.css`.
4. **Stitch HTML** — `it_tender_wizard_impl/*.html` is design reference only; do not mount at runtime for native/migrated screens.
5. **Fonts** — self-hosted via `kt_fonts.css` only (no Google Fonts CDN).
6. **Sidebar** — Procurement left rail visible; call `preserve_procurement_sidebar()` on page show.
7. **CSS scoping** — body shell class per [`frappe-custom-page-css-scoping.mdc`](frappe-custom-page-css-scoping.mdc).
8. **Tests** — per-screen Makefile gates only ([`it-wizard-test-gate.mdc`](it-wizard-test-gate.mdc)); Playwright uses plain DOM (no iframe hydration wait for native screens).
9. **Screen 01 precedent** — extract reusable components; never copy the monolith into new screens.

## Forbidden

- New `mount_page()` wiring for production screens
- Tailwind CDN (`cdn.tailwindcss.com`) in production JS/CSS or native screen assets
- Runtime iframe + hydrator for screens marked **native** in the UI tracker
- Cross-document iframe event handling for new work
- 15 one-off page implementations without shared shell/components

## Screen module pattern

```javascript
frappe.pages["it-tender-configuration-<screen>"].on_page_load = function (wrapper) {
  frappe.require([
    "/assets/kentender_procurement/js/it_wizard/it_wizard_shell.js",
    "/assets/kentender_procurement/js/it_wizard/screens/<screen>.js",
  ], function () {
    kentender.it_wizard.screens.<screen>.init(wrapper);
  });
};
```

## Migration status

Check **Architecture** column in [`UI_IMPLEMENTATION_TRACKER.md`](apps/kentender_v1/docs/std-prod-impl/IT-STD-Wizard/UI_IMPLEMENTATION_TRACKER.md):

- `native` — must follow this rule exclusively
- `iframe-transitional` — legacy path allowed until migrated; do not extend iframe pattern for new features on native screens

## Gate

```bash
make it-wizard-native-architecture-gate SITE=kentender.midas.com
```

Run when changing IT Wizard Desk wiring, shared library, or native screen modules.
